{"item_uid": "指考92-geography-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 92, "year_ce": 2003, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "王先生最近移民澳洲雪梨，想買㆒間面向正北方的㆓層樓房。為了在房子後方的空\n㆞找出全年陽光都照不到的㆞方，以便規劃植栽的內容，王先生應該選擇在㆘列哪\n㆒個㈪份某㈰的㆗午時刻去參觀？", "options": {"A": "㆔㈪", "B": "㈥㈪", "C": "㈨㈪", "D": "㈩㆓㈪"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
