{"item_uid": "指考92-geography-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 92, "year_ce": 2003, "subject_key": "geography", "subject_zh": "地理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "丹麥是㆗、西歐和斯堪㆞半島間往來的陸橋，也是控制哪㆓個海域間通航的門戶，\n而素㈲「北歐㈩字路口國」之稱？", "options": {"A": "黑海、波羅的海", "B": "㆞㆗海、大西洋", "C": "波羅的海、北海", "D": "北海、北極海"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
